"A download password is made for each file and shown to you, to pass on "
"separately. Needs Microsoft 365 or OneDrive for Business"
msgstr ""
"Es crea una contrasenya de descàrrega per a cada fitxer i se't mostra, per "
"fer-la arribar per separat. Necessita Microsoft 365 o OneDrive for Business"

